{"action": "shared_understanding_confirmed", "at": "2026-09-26T18:36:00+00:00", "data": {"summary": "Products page same Save as Regular and Sale: clerk checks or unchecks Manage stock. New products default off. On hides In stock/Out of stock/On backorder and persists setup-required with no auto Configure Inventory, no quantity, no install popup. Off restores dormant stock status, drops the Commerce setup claim, does not contact Inventory, and leaves pool quantity (the 6 red hats) in place. Later enable is not already-claimed; existing SKU is needs-review confirm; title does not remap. Toggle does not rewrite Regular or Sale. A refused Manage stock write leaves prices unchanged. Out: Allow backorders admin, Configure Inventory walk, marketplace install, auto-link, title remap, live quantity on this page. Proof: bin/verify-commerce full plus Products admin check/uncheck/recheck with prices unchanged."}, "event_id": "700f7494-b6b6-4603-9562-577e139995c4"}
